  /// The current status of the bulk operation can be one of the following
  /// values: IN_PROGRESS DynamoDB is processing the input. COMPLETED The bulk
  /// operation finished without parsing or validation errors. Condition-check
  /// failures do not cause the operation to complete with errors.
