  /// configured Amazon S3 output location. CANCELLING DynamoDB accepted a
  /// cancellation request and is stopping the operation. CANCELLED DynamoDB
  /// stopped the operation after a cancellation request. FAILED The bulk
  /// operation failed. DynamoDB might write some items before the operation
  /// reaches this status. See FailureCode and FailureMessage for details.
