  /// The current state of the replica: CREATING - The replica is being
  /// created. UPDATING - The replica is being updated. DELETING - The replica
  /// is being deleted. ACTIVE - The replica is ready for use. REGION_DISABLED
  /// - The replica is inaccessible because the Amazon Web Services Region has
  /// been disabled. If the Amazon Web Services Region remains inaccessible
  /// for more than 20 hours, DynamoDB will remove this replica from the
  /// replication group. The replica will not be deleted and replication will
  /// stop from and to this region. INACCESSIBLE_ENCRYPTION_CREDENTIALS - The
  /// KMS key used to encrypt the table is inaccessible. If the KMS key
  /// remains inaccessible for more than 20 hours, DynamoDB will remove this
  /// replica from the replication group. The replica will not be deleted and
  /// replication will stop from and to this region.
